  "body": "Hey i have a user here from matrix.org who locked theirself out of a room which before got a telematrix alias from my homeserver.\r\nThey wan't to keep the alias which still is assigned to the room at matrix.org.\r\n\r\nThe only way to remove the alias i found was:\r\n```\r\ncurl -H 'Authorization: Bearer <snip>' -X DELETE https://localdomain.de/_matrix/client/r0/directory/room/%23telegram_%3A<snip>:localdomain.de\r\n```\r\nBut it fails like:\r\n```\r\n{\r\n    \"errcode\": \"M_UNKNOWN\",\r\n    \"error\": \"Room alias must be local\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nRegards",
